// Module under test: lib/debounce.csp, loaded by {lib, ...} in the .expect.
// A contact that rings every cycle for 30 cycles and then settles high; Out
// must ignore every bounce and follow only after the settle period.
#variable B:1 unsigned = 0
#variable n = 0
#Debounce d
d.In = B
n = n + 1
B = n % 2 ? n < 30          // ring every cycle
B = 1     ? n >= 30         // then hold high
